146:	TrivyScanTimeout       SettingVariable `key:"trivyScanTimeout,envOverride" meta:"label=Trivy Scan Timeout;type=number;keywords=trivy,vulnerability,scan,timeout,seconds,cve;category=timeouts;description=Timeout for Trivy image scans in seconds (default: 900 = 15 minutes)"`
